    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Grounded Retrieval Defense",
      "items": [
        "Retrieved scope passages are injected as untrusted context with strict bounding system prompts.",
        "When top similarity score is below 0.35, the system returns an insufficient-evidence notice without LLM hallucination."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Dual Fallback Mechanics",
      "items": [
        "Atlas Vector Search ReferenceError at line 84 drops into catch, triggering in-memory cosine ranking over MongoDB chunks.",
